cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "loopy-collisions: exhaustive collision search for the loopy polynomial"
abstract: >-
  C and Python code accompanying "The Loopy Polynomial: from Tutte's Universal
  V-Function to Bizonotopal Geometry".  Verifies that the loopy polynomial, the
  refined loopy polynomial and the Tutte symmetric function induce the same
  partition of the connected simple graphs on at most eleven vertices.
